<title>KAZAKHSTAN: Kazakh tenge rises to 73.4336 to dlr.</title>
<headline>Kazakh tenge rises to 73.4336 to dlr.</headline>
<dateline>ALMATY 1996-12-19</dateline>
<text>
<p>The tenge rose to 73.4336 per dollar on the Kazakhstan Currency Exchange on Thursday from 73.6556 on Wednesday.</p>
<p>				    Dec 19		  Dec 18</p>
<p>    tenge per dollar	  73.4336		 73.6556</p>
<p>    volume ($ mln)	     3.005		   7.110</p>
<p>				    Dec 19		  Dec 13</p>
<p>    tenge per mark	    47.5424		 47.0000</p>
<p>    volume (DM mln)	    0.190		   0.050</p>
<p>--Almaty Newsroom, + 7 3272 509410</p>
</text>
